  "title": "When should I be using DeepSeek 3FS for AI?",
  "summary": "DeepSeek 3FS is an open-source distributed file system built specifically for large, read-heavy AI workloads. It delivers strong consistency and fast random reads, but comes with slower writes and significant operational complexity, making it a good fit only for teams running AI at serious scale.",
